OL,3,GNEWSANew rules for Reform-run libraries
OL,4,Aafter Pride row
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Reform-led council has outlined
OL,7,Fproposals to govern displays in its
OL,8,Flibraries four months after the
OL,9,Fadministration came under fire for
OL,10,Fbanning LGBTQ+ Pride displays.
OL,12,FThe new draft guidance, to be
OL,13,Fconsidered by a Staffordshire County
OL,14,FCouncil scrutiny committee on Thursday,
OL,15,Freveals which events will be marked
OL,16,Fwith library displays, including local
OL,17,Fhistory, St George's Day, Remembrance
OL,18,FDay and Armed Forces Day, as well as
OL,19,Fpromotion for fostering and recycling
OL,20,Fin the county.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
