OL,3,GNEWSANew rules for Reform-run libraries
OL,4,Aafter Pride row
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, there is no place on the draft
OL,7,Fschedule for the year ahead for Pride,
OL,8,FBlack History Month or non-Christian
OL,9,Fcultural events.
OL,11,FThe council said it wanted libraries to
OL,12,Fbe politically neutral spaces open to
OL,13,Feveryone.
